\u2026</p>\n</div><!-- .entry-summary -->\n<div class=\"entry-meta entry-utility\">\n<span class=\"author vcard\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n<i class=\"icon-author icon-metas\" title=\"Author\"></i>\n<a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/tylerprochnow/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"author\" title=\"View all posts by Tyler Prochnow\">\n<em itemprop=\"name\">Tyler Prochnow</em>\n</a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"onDate date\">\n<i class=\"icon-date icon-metas\" title=\"Date\"></i>\n<time class=\"published\" datetime=\"2020-07-29T16:41:39-04:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n\t\t\t\t\tJuly 29, 2020\t\t\t\t</time>\n<time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2020-07-29T16:41:40-04:00\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">July 29, 2020</time>\n</span>\n<span class=\"bl_categ\">\n<i class=\"icon-category icon-metas\" title=\"Categories\"></i> <a href=\"/category/research-results/\" rel=\"category tag\">Research Results</a></span> </div><!-- .entry-utility -->\n<footer class=\"post-continue-container\">\n<a class=\"continue-reading-link\" href=\"/shared-decision-making-with-youth-adding-rungs-of-consent-advocacy-and-incorporation-to-the-ladder-of-citizen-participation/\"><span>Continue reading</span><em class=\"screen-reader-text\">\"Shared Decision-Making with Youth: Adding Rungs of Consent, Advocacy, and Incorporation to the Ladder of Citizen Participation\"</em><i class=\"icon-continue-reading\"></i></a> </footer>\n<span class=\"schema-publisher\" itemprop=\"publisher\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Organization\">\n<span itemprop=\"logo\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n<meta content=\"/\" itemprop=\"url\"/>\n</span>\n<meta content=\"Physical Activity Research Center\" itemprop=\"name\"/>\n</span>\n<link href=\"/shared-decision-making-with-youth-adding-rungs-of-consent-advocacy-and-incorporation-to-the-ladder-of-citizen-participation/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\"/> </div><!-- .article-inner -->\n</article><!-- #post-1653 -->\n<article class=\"hentry post-1643 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-resource\" id=\"post-1643\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/BlogPosting\">\n<div class=\"article-inner\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<div class=\"entry-meta beforetitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\" itemprop=\"headline\"><a href=\"/infographic-physical-activity-and-recreation-in-children-in-communities-of-color/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\" rel=\"bookmark\">Infographic: Physical Activity and Recreation in Children in Communities of Color</a></h2>\n<div class=\"entry-meta aftertitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-summary\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<p>Public parks represent key settings for promoting physical activity among children who are least likely to be active and most likely to be overweight or obese. Describing park use patterns among different racial and ethnic groups, particularly in low-income neighborhoods, can inform planning decisions on how to meet diverse recreation \u2026</p>\n</div><!-- .entry-summary -->\n<div class=\"entry-meta entry-utility\">\n<span class=\"author vcard\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n<i class=\"icon-author icon-metas\" title=\"Author\"></i>\n<a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/tylerprochnow/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"author\" title=\"View all posts by Tyler Prochnow\">\n<em itemprop=\"name\">Tyler Prochnow</em>\n</a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"onDate date\">\n<i class=\"icon-date icon-metas\" title=\"Date\"></i>\n<time class=\"published\" datetime=\"2020-06-03T17:05:25-04:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 3, 2020\t\t\t\t</time>\n<time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-03T17:08:06-04:00\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">June 3, 2020</time>\n</span>\n<span class=\"bl_categ\">\n<i class=\"icon-category icon-metas\" title=\"Categories\"></i> <a href=\"/category/resource/\" rel=\"category tag\">Resource</a></span> </div><!-- .entry-utility -->\n<footer class=\"post-continue-container\">\n<a class=\"continue-reading-link\" href=\"/infographic-physical-activity-and-recreation-in-children-in-communities-of-color/\"><span>Continue reading</span><em class=\"screen-reader-text\">\"Infographic: Physical Activity and Recreation in Children in Communities of Color\"</em><i class=\"icon-continue-reading\"></i></a> </footer>\n<span class=\"schema-publisher\" itemprop=\"publisher\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Organization\">\n<span itemprop=\"logo\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n<meta content=\"/\" itemprop=\"url\"/>\n</span>\n<meta content=\"Physical Activity Research Center\" itemprop=\"name\"/>\n</span>\n<link href=\"/infographic-physical-activity-and-recreation-in-children-in-communities-of-color/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\"/> </div><!-- .article-inner -->\n</article><!-- #post-1643 -->\n<article class=\"hentry post-1639 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-resource tag-infographic tag-racial-disparities tag-summer tag-youth-physical-activity\" id=\"post-1639\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/BlogPosting\">\n<div class=\"article-inner\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<div class=\"entry-meta beforetitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\" itemprop=\"headline\"><a href=\"/infographic-youth-physical-activity-in-summer-patterns-and-disparities/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\" rel=\"bookmark\">Infographic: Youth Physical Activity in Summer Patterns and Disparities</a></h2>\n<div class=\"entry-meta aftertitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-summary\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<p>Adolescents have lower levels of physical activity (PA) and more rapid weight gain during summertime when they are not attending school. African American and Latino youth gain more weight in the summer than do youth from other racial or ethnic groups. Given disparities in summer weight gain, it is important \u2026</p>\n</div><!-- .entry-summary -->\n<div class=\"entry-meta entry-utility\">\n<span class=\"author vcard\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n<i class=\"icon-author icon-metas\" title=\"Author\"></i>\n<a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/tylerprochnow/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"author\" title=\"View all posts by Tyler Prochnow\">\n<em itemprop=\"name\">Tyler Prochnow</em>\n</a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"onDate date\">\n<i class=\"icon-date icon-metas\" title=\"Date\"></i>\n<time class=\"published\" datetime=\"2020-06-02T23:14:09-04:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 2, 2020\t\t\t\t</time>\n<time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-02T23:14:11-04:00\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">June 2, 2020</time>\n</span>\n<span class=\"bl_categ\">\n<i class=\"icon-category icon-metas\" title=\"Categories\"></i> <a href=\"/category/resource/\" rel=\"category tag\">Resource</a></span> </div><!-- .entry-utility -->\n<footer class=\"post-continue-container\">\n<a class=\"continue-reading-link\" href=\"/infographic-youth-physical-activity-in-summer-patterns-and-disparities/\"><span>Continue reading</span><em class=\"screen-reader-text\">\"Infographic: Youth Physical Activity in Summer Patterns and Disparities\"</em><i class=\"icon-continue-reading\"></i></a> </footer>\n<span class=\"schema-publisher\" itemprop=\"publisher\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Organization\">\n<span itemprop=\"logo\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n<meta content=\"/\" itemprop=\"url\"/>\n</span>\n<meta content=\"Physical Activity Research Center\" itemprop=\"name\"/>\n</span>\n<link href=\"/infographic-youth-physical-activity-in-summer-patterns-and-disparities/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\"/> </div><!-- .article-inner -->\n</article><!-- #post-1639 -->\n<article class=\"hentry post-1479 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-press-release category-resource tag-children tag-parc tag-physical-activity tag-video\" id=\"post-1479\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/BlogPosting\">\n<div class=\"article-inner\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<div class=\"entry-meta beforetitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\" itemprop=\"headline\"><a href=\"/official-parc-introduction-video/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\" rel=\"bookmark\">Official PARC Introduction Video</a></h2>\n<div class=\"entry-meta aftertitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-summary\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<p>Official PARC Introduction Video Here at PARC, we are advocating for physical activity to be an everyday part of life for all children. Check out this video to learn more!</p>\n</div><!-- .entry-summary -->\n<div class=\"entry-meta entry-utility\">\n<span class=\"author vcard\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n<i class=\"icon-author icon-metas\" title=\"Author\"></i>\n<a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/tylerprochnow/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"author\" title=\"View all posts by Tyler Prochnow\">\n<em itemprop=\"name\">Tyler Prochnow</em>\n</a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"onDate date\">\n<i class=\"icon-date icon-metas\" title=\"Date\"></i>\n<time class=\"published\" datetime=\"2020-03-04T23:45:29-05:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n\t\t\t\t\tMarch 4, 2020\t\t\t\t</time>\n<time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-02T22:59:02-04:00\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">June 2, 2020</time>\n</span>\n<span class=\"bl_categ\">\n<i class=\"icon-category icon-metas\" title=\"Categories\"></i> <a href=\"/category/press-release/\" rel=\"category tag\">Press Release</a> / <a href=\"/category/resource/\" rel=\"category tag\">Resource</a></span> </div><!-- .entry-utility -->\n<footer class=\"pos